@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

start
:Parse name keywords;
:Parse role-title keywords;
:Parse candidate-status values;
if (No criteria supplied?) then (yes)
    :Keep every candidate;
else (no)
    :Evaluate each candidate;
    if (Any name keyword matches?) then (yes)
        :Keep candidate;
    elseif (Any role-title keyword matches?) then (yes)
        :Keep candidate;
    elseif (Candidate status is selected?) then (yes)
        :Keep candidate;
    else (no)
        :Hide candidate;
    endif
endif
:Regenerate visible indices;
stop

note right
All supplied criteria are alternatives (OR),
not cumulative (AND). Matching is case-insensitive.
The find command has no role-status filter;
role status is handled by the role list commands.
end note
@enduml
